   "06/12/2019 1340",
   "Media (Outside Record)",
   "Anesthesia",
   "C-N Anesthesia (scanned intraop record)",
   "L4-5 microdiscectomy, prone. Wt 158 kg. Preoxygenation 3 min. Propofol 200 mg, succinylcholine 160 mg. Mask ventilation grade 3 (two-hand with OPA, inadequate). VL (C-MAC 4): grade IIb, first pass with bougie, 8.0 ETT. SpO2 nadir 84% during intubation. Extubated awake in semi-upright position to CPAP. Airway note: \"Difficult mask ventilation. Recommend ramped position, HFNO preoxygenation, VL first.\""
